      "kwargs": {
        "title": "Short and Stout",
        "riddle": "On the first of April 1998 the IETF published a standard for controlling coffee pots over HTTP. It reserves an error for the case where you ask a teapot to brew. The document says the resulting entity body MAY be short and one other thing. Give that word.",
